<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll" itunes:timing="Line" xml:lang="zh-Hant"><head><metadata><amll:meta key="ncmMusicId" value="28242918"/><amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1732660138"/><amll:meta key="musicName" value="为爱而活"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="张韶涵"/><amll:meta key="album" value="张韶涵Angela Zhang"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithub" value="149807805"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithubLogin" value="Ma-hiru"/></metadata></head><body dur="03:49.597"><div begin="00:05.515" end="03:49.897"><p begin="00:05.515" end="00:09.568" itunes:key="L374">是誰的靈魂碎片 鋪滿荒蕪房間<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">是谁的灵魂碎片 铺满荒芜房间</span></p><p begin="00:09.719" end="00:12.720" itunes:key="L375">隱形卻比荊棘尖銳<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">隐形却比荆棘尖锐</span></p><p begin="00:13.876" end="00:17.864" itunes:key="L376">現實對著夢狩獵 有傷口卻不流血<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">现实对着梦狩猎 有伤口却不流血</span></p><p begin="00:18.069" end="00:20.781" itunes:key="L377">怎麼熬過無聲黑夜<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">怎么熬过无声黑夜</span></p><p begin="00:21.827" end="00:25.799" itunes:key="L378">逃避沒有出口 誰敢承認犯錯<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">逃避没有出口 谁敢承认犯错</span></p><p begin="00:25.954" end="00:30.150" itunes:key="L379">勇敢才擁有真正的解脫<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">勇敢才拥有真正的解脱</span></p><p begin="00:30.347" end="00:34.179" itunes:key="L380">害怕顫抖的手 我學著合十緊握<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">害怕颤抖的手 我学着合十紧握</span></p><p begin="00:34.344" end="00:37.043" itunes:key="L381">給自己一個承諾<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">给自己一个承诺</span></p><p begin="00:37.053" end="00:44.787" itunes:key="L382">破曉的時刻 未來是我的<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">破晓的时刻 未来是我的</span></p><p begin="00:45.192" end="00:53.566" itunes:key="L383">嚐遍了苦澀 倔強是我的<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">尝遍了苦涩 倔强是我的</span></p><p begin="00:53.576" end="00:57.871" itunes:key="L384">心會發光的 微弱卻炙熱<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">心会发光的 微弱却炙热</span></p><p begin="00:58.056" end="01:01.431" itunes:key="L385">信仰愛就有可能<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">信仰爱就有可能</span></p><p begin="01:01.707" end="01:05.289" itunes:key="L386">你會發光的<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你会发光的</span></p><p begin="01:05.711" end="01:14.355" itunes:key="L387">When you live for love<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">When you live for love</span></p><p begin="01:19.300" end="01:23.469" itunes:key="L388">我發誓我再也不要做後悔的影子<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我发誓我再也不要做后悔的影子</span></p><p begin="01:23.615" end="01:26.512" itunes:key="L389">每刻重新詮釋<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">每刻重新诠释</span></p><p begin="01:27.467" end="01:31.686" itunes:key="L390">生命在倒數計時 不夠讓我們奢侈<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">生命在倒数计时 不够让我们奢侈</span></p><p begin="01:31.874" end="01:34.964" itunes:key="L391">想愛就不要掩飾<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">想爱就不要掩饰</span></p><p begin="01:35.682" end="01:39.626" itunes:key="L392">逃避沒有出口 誰敢承認犯錯<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">逃避没有出口 谁敢承认犯错</span></p><p begin="01:39.892" end="01:43.956" itunes:key="L393">勇敢才是我們唯一的自由<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">勇敢才是我们唯一的自由</span></p><p begin="01:44.174" end="01:48.201" itunes:key="L394">不再顫抖的手 闊步昂首地走<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">不再颤抖的手 阔步昂首地走</span></p><p begin="01:48.262" end="01:52.197" itunes:key="L395">去實現我的承諾<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">去实现我的承诺</span></p><p begin="01:50.908" end="01:58.673" itunes:key="L396">破曉的時刻 未來是我的<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">破晓的时刻 未来是我的</span></p><p begin="01:59.043" end="02:07.452" itunes:key="L397">嚐遍了苦澀 倔強是我的<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">尝遍了苦涩 倔强是我的</span></p><p begin="02:07.462" end="02:11.513" itunes:key="L398">心會發光的 微弱卻炙熱<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">心会发光的 微弱却炙热</span></p><p begin="02:11.698" end="02:15.261" itunes:key="L399">信仰愛就有可能<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">信仰爱就有可能</span></p><p begin="02:15.525" end="02:19.111" itunes:key="L400">你會發光的<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你会发光的</span></p><p begin="02:19.554" end="02:28.383" itunes:key="L401">When you live for love<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">When you live for love</span></p><p begin="02:34.042" end="02:40.714" itunes:key="L402">像個孩子笑著哭著流下領悟的淚<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">像个孩子笑着哭着流下领悟的泪</span></p><p begin="02:41.922" end="02:48.048" itunes:key="L403">洗去不知不覺 無法避免沾附的謊言<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">洗去不知不觉 无法避免沾附的谎言</span></p><p begin="02:48.410" end="02:58.154" itunes:key="L404">我信仰 明天<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我信仰 明天</span></p><p begin="02:58.636" end="03:06.409" itunes:key="L405">破曉的時刻 未來是我的<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">破晓的时刻 未来是我的</span></p><p begin="03:06.686" end="03:15.121" itunes:key="L406">嚐遍了苦澀 倔強是我的<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">尝遍了苦涩 倔强是我的</span></p><p begin="03:15.131" end="03:21.143" itunes:key="L407">心會發光的 微弱卻炙熱 (發光的 卻炙熱)<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">心会发光的 微弱却炙热 (发光的 却炙热)</span></p><p begin="03:19.482" end="03:22.836" itunes:key="L408">信仰愛就有可能<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">信仰爱就有可能</span></p><p begin="03:23.031" end="03:26.892" itunes:key="L409">你會發光的<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你会发光的</span></p><p begin="03:27.077" end="03:35.975" itunes:key="L410">When you live for love<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">When you live for love</span></p><p begin="03:33.730" end="03:35.869" itunes:key="L411">When you live for<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">When you live for</span></p><p begin="03:35.964" end="03:39.678" itunes:key="L412">When you live for love<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">When you live for love</span></p><p begin="03:39.972" end="03:41.850" itunes:key="L413">When you live for<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">When you live for</span></p><p begin="03:42.097" end="03:44.173" itunes:key="L414">When you live for<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">When you live for</span></p><p begin="03:44.262" end="03:49.897" itunes:key="L415">When you live for love<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">When you live for love</span></p></div></body></tt>